         smooth: (0.50s, ζ=0.86)  — gentle settle, sub-perceptual overshoot ~0.5%
         snappy: (0.42s, ζ=0.78)  — quick crisp, eased to fill its clock, overshoot ~+2.0%
         bouncy: (0.50s, ζ=0.55)  — emphatic, overshoot ~+12.6% (the Apple 12-18% band)
         gentle: (0.70s, ζ=1.00)  — patient critically-damped
         dock:   (0.56s, ζ=0.58)  — the WEIGHTY iOS-27 gooey morph (collapse/expand + V↔H + fission), slow inertial settle, audacious overshoot ~+11%
